VT_TRANSLATION("NAVIGATION\n\nD-pad means the directional buttons; left/right mean those buttons, not the sticks. Stick controls are named explicitly.\n\n or tap the logo: open Sections. D-pad/left stick selects,  opens,  closes the panel.  opens page options;  and  close the opposite panel. Multi-column menus also accept left/right. Only the vertical  lists in Legacy, VMD, Deck 90 and Aperture scroll with up/down, the left stick, dragging or bottom arrows. The Ghost Mesh, Signal, Relay and Mosaic wheel/grids stay fixed: use directions to select entries in their actual positions. All actions remain visible. The title and controls stay fixed.\n\nSections: Home, Network, Jellyfin, Navidrome, Immich, Radio/Podcast, IPTV, Settings, Controls guide and About. Player and Download appear when available. In browsers with a visible mini-player, Start restores playback and Select is reserved for input lock; use available options for other actions or stop the mini-player first.\n\nIn this guide: up/down selects a chapter; Right or  enters its text. Up/down scrolls text, Left returns to the index. Tap chapters or text and drag to scroll.  exits;  opens Sections.\n\nSettings: left/right changes tabs; Down or  enters rows. Up/down selects,  changes the value. Touch selects or activates the visible control.\n\nHOME AND THEMES\n\nIntegrated Home: the Home tab brings together unfinished media, saved connections, favourites and recent activity. The d-pad or left stick moves between widgets;  opens the selected item.  shows the next item in that widget,  the previous one.  searches all media;  focuses the sections. Explore sources and History open full collections, not alternative Home views. Saved connections open the actual server using the usual authentication and trust prompts.\n\nIn search,  changes provider;  opens media/folders/feeds.  goes back and then returns Home;  returns Home. Cache and progressive results stay usable while sources respond. Up to 24 results per provider; resume is local and radio/channels reopen live.\n\nThe tabs are Home, Video, Music, Radio, Podcast and Images. Radio and online podcasts show favourites; open discovery with  > Radio/Podcast. Newer themes show offline podcasts as an entry to open; Legacy places them beside online favourites.\n\nThe first hints above describe the active theme. Other guide chapters use the same controls unless stated otherwise.\n\nLegacy / VMD: from the first row, press Up to focus tabs. Left/right changes tabs; Down enters results. D-pad/left stick navigates results;  opens.\n\nVMD uses Sony PAF components across the app with Legacy layout and controls. Hold + at startup to recover to Legacy if it cannot start.\n\nGhost Mesh: the right stick selects a section on the wheel. Return it to centre before selecting again after closing a menu. D-pad and left stick always control the list on the left.  opens the selected entry; the two sides remain independent.\n\nDeck 90: up/down selects in the left menu. Right or  enters results; Left returns to the menu. Up/down scrolls results;  opens.\n\nSignal: left/right selects the top tabs; Down or  enters results. Up from the first row returns to tabs. Use grid directions within results.\n\nAperture: tabs are at the bottom. Left/right selects; Up or  enters content. Down from the last entry returns to tabs. Up/down scrolls content;  opens.\n\nRelay: up/down selects in the side menu; Right or  enters the grid. Left from its left edge returns to the menu; elsewhere it moves between cards.\n\nMosaic: left/right selects the top tabs; Down or  enters covers. Left/right selects a cover within the page; Down advances a page, Up returns to the previous page. Up from the first page returns to tabs.\n\nTap visible sections and entries. Change order in Settings > Interface > Theme tab positions: up/down selects an entry, left/right moves it,  saves,  cancels. Each theme keeps its own order.\n\nRADIO AND PODCASTS\n\n > Radio/Podcast opens discovery.  groups search, countries/genres, favourites, URL entry and refresh. In station/show lists,  searches, Start adds a URL and  adds or removes the favourite, including from Home.  names the action explicitly. In the provider, Up from the first row focuses Radio/Podcast tabs; left/right switches provider and Down or  enters content.  retraces previous levels and keeps the selection. In countries,  selects and  searches; Start resets the default catalogue. A short Select press opens details.\n\n on a station starts listening. In the player,  pauses; Play reconnects live without replaying old audio. Titles and artwork depend on the station.\n\nPodcasts resume from saved progress, including after a restart. Saving runs in the background; forcibly closing the app can lose roughly the last 15 seconds. Completed episodes or progress below ten seconds start at the beginning.\n\n on a podcast opens episodes.  on an episode streams it; Start downloads to your chosen folder.  or a short Select press opens description and authors.  returns to the previous list. Scroll to load more pages.\n\nIPTV\n\n > IPTV shows saved playlists and channels. Select Add M3U playlist and press . Enter the playlist HTTP(S) link or choose Scan QR. Add and open asks for a name, validates the playlist, saves it and opens its channels. Extensionless links work; this flow always treats them as playlists. Open without saving is for this session only.\n\nThe d-pad and left stick follow the visible layout. Up moves from channels to their actions and then the top controls; Down returns to the grid. An incomplete last row still has a downward neighbour.  opens a playlist or plays a channel;  toggles its favourite.  searches; Select renames the entry or current playlist.  offers management, refresh and filters.\n\nAfter adding,  returns to saved entries with the new playlist selected. Open without saving returns to the form. Open a direct stream in Options separates a single HLS/DASH or video-file link from channel playlists; its format is automatic and Select changes it when needed.\n\nIn playback,  opens Video quality, Audio language and Programme. Choose a row with Up/Down and  to see the source variants and available languages;  applies the selection. Playback reconnects and restores the previous format if the new one fails. 1080p and bitrates above 4 Mbps are not automatically blocked. Programme shows title, times, description and the next show when the playlist provides XMLTV; Up/Down scrolls and  refreshes.\n\nDuring connection,  or Cancel stops loading. In playback  pauses/resumes and  toggles the favourite. Live resumes at the live point; segmented VOD resumes in place without seeking. Compatible MP4/MKV files use the video-player controls.\n\nNETWORK AND DOWNLOADS\n\nNetwork:  adds a server,  edits, a short Select press removes its saved configuration.  connects or opens.  opens options where available. In remote folders,  refreshes;  opens Jellyfin details or downloads from file servers.\n\nJellyfin:  > Jellyfin, immediately before Navidrome, opens existing saved servers.  connects,  adds,  edits;  also offers Remove connection with confirmation. Videos use the video-player controls; returning restores the folder and selection.\n\nNavidrome and Immich: open their  section or Music/Images entry.  connects,  adds,  edits;  opens Options with Connect, Add, Edit and Remove connection. Removal requires a fresh  confirmation;  cancels and remote content is retained. Navidrome uses the music player, Immich the image viewer.\n\nOpen Network > Direct link/QR or IPTV > Start > Scan QR, then aim at an HTTP/HTTPS link.  or Cancel returns without accepting it. Text entry and confirmation use the system keyboard.\n\nDownload destination:  enters a folder,  creates one, Start chooses the current location.  goes to its parent and cancels at the root. During transfer, Start pauses/resumes;  aborts. Background or  lets it continue;  > Download reopens progress.\n\nPLAYER\n\nThe first line above shows the active video/music mapping. Normally  opens Sections,  Options and left/right seeks. Settings > Controls can swap these groups: directional buttons open panels and / seek. The horizontal left stick remains a seek control. Live radio cannot seek.\n\n pauses/resumes. Vertical right stick changes volume. A short Start press, released before about one second, minimizes where supported; in the mini-player it restores fullscreen. Hold Start for about one second to toggle OLED ECO. Hold Select for about one second to lock/unlock input; a short press does not lock it.\n\nTap video to show/hide controls. Drag the timeline to seek where available.  stops fullscreen playback; use a short Start press to keep listening.\n\nVideo options: up/down selects a row; left/right prepares an audio/subtitle choice,  applies it;  closes the panel. Seeking keeps the subtitle selection on supported files.\n\nMusic options: up/down selects;  or left/right changes shuffle, repeat or colours.  > Player changes artwork layout without restarting audio. Layout follows the theme or your saved choice.\n\nIMAGES\n\n zooms in.  zooms out.  rotates 90 degrees. Start resets zoom, position and rotation. D-pad/left stick pans; release to stop movement.\n\nDrag with one finger to pan; pinch with two to zoom. Tap to show/hide controls.  opens Sections,  image information.  closes an open panel or returns to files.\n\nRotation cycles through 0, 90, 180 and 270 degrees. The right stick and two-finger twist are not rotation controls.", "導航\n\nD-pad 表示方向按鈕；左/右指的是按鈕，而不是搖桿。搖桿控制有明確的命名。\n\n 或點擊標誌：開啟部分。方向鍵/左搖桿選擇， 打開， 關閉面板。  開啟頁面選項；和關閉對面的面板。多列選單也接受左/右。 Legacy、VMD、Deck 90 和 Aperture 中只有垂直  清單可透過上/下、左搖桿、拖曳或底部箭頭滾動。幽靈網格、訊號、中繼和馬賽克輪/網格保持固定：使用方向在實際位置選擇條目。所有操作均保持可見。標題和控制項保持固定。\n\n部分：主頁、網路、Jellyfin、Navidrome、Immich、廣播/播客、IPTV、設定、控制指南和關於。播放器和下載可用時出現。在具有可見迷你播放器的瀏覽器中，「開始」恢復播放，「選擇」保留用於輸入鎖定；使用可用選項進行其他操作或首先停止迷你播放器。\n\n在本指南中： 上/下選擇章節；右鍵或 輸入其文字。向上/向下滾動文本，向左返回索引。點擊章節或文字並拖曳以捲動。  退出；  開啟部分。\n\n設定：左/右更改標籤；向下或  輸入行。上/下選擇， 改變數值。觸控選擇或啟動可見控制。\n\n首頁和主題\n\n整合主頁：「主頁」標籤匯集了未完成的媒體、已儲存的連線、收藏夾和最近的活動。方向鍵或左搖桿在小工具之間移動； 開啟所選項目。  顯示該小工具中的下一項， 顯示上一項。  搜尋所有媒體；  重點關注部分。探索來源和歷史打開完整的收藏，而不是替代的主頁視圖。保存的連線使用通常的身份驗證和信任提示打開實際伺服器。\n\n在搜尋中， 更改提供者； 開啟媒體/資料夾/提要。 返回，然後返回Home； 回家了。當來源回應時，快取和漸進結果保持可用。每個提供者最多 24 個結果；恢復是本地的，廣播/頻道重新開放直播。\n\n這些選項卡包括“主頁”、“視訊”、“音樂”、“廣播”、“播客”和“圖像”。廣播和線上播客顯示最愛；使用  > 廣播/播客進行開放發現。較新的主題將離線播客顯示為打開的入口；傳統將它們置於網上最愛的旁邊。\n\n上面的第一個提示描述了活動主題。除非另有說明，其他指南章節使用相同的控制。\n\n舊版/VMD：從第一行開始，按向上鍵可聚焦選項卡。左/右更改選項卡；向下輸入結果。方向鍵/左搖桿導航結果； 開啟。\n\nVMD 在整個應用程式中使用索尼 PAF 元件以及傳統佈局和控制。啟動時按住+，若無法啟動，可恢復到Legacy。\n\n幽靈網格：右搖桿選擇輪盤上的一個部分。關閉選單後再次選擇之前將其返回中心。方向鍵和左搖桿始終控制左側的清單。  開啟所選條目；雙方保持獨立。\n\nDeck 90：在左側選單中向上/向下選擇。右或輸入結果；向左返回選單。向上/向下捲動結果；  開啟。\n\n訊號：左/右選擇頂部標籤；向下或 輸入結果。從第一行向上返回選項卡。在結果中使用網格方向。\n\n光圈：選項卡位於底部。左/右選擇；向上或輸入內容。從最後一個條目向下返回選項卡。向上/向下捲動內容；  開啟。\n\n繼電器：側面選單中上/下選擇；右或進入網格。向左從其左邊緣返回選單；在其他地方，它會在卡片之間移動。\n\n馬賽克：左/右選擇頂部標籤；向下或進蓋。左/右選擇頁面內的封面；向下前進一頁，向上回到上一頁。从第一页向上返回到选项卡。\n\n點擊可見部分和條目。在「設定」>「介面」>「主題」標籤位置中變更順序：上/下選擇項目，左/右移動條目， 儲存， 取消。每個主題都有自己的順序。\n\n廣播和播客\n\n > 廣播/播客開啟發現。  分組搜尋、國家/流派、收藏夾、URL 輸入和刷新。在電台/節目列表中， 搜索，開始添加 URL， 添加或刪除收藏夾，包括從主頁中刪除。  明確命名該操作。在提供者中，從第一行向上聚焦「廣播/播客」標籤；左/右切換提供者並向下或  輸入內容。  回撤之前的水平並保留選擇。在國家中， 選擇， 搜尋；開始重置預設目錄。短按選擇鍵可開啟詳細資料。\n\n電台上的  開始收聽。播放器中， 暫停；播放重新連接即時，無需重播舊音訊。標題和藝術作品取決於電台。\n\n播客從已儲存的進度恢復，包括重新啟動後。在背景儲存運行；強行關閉應用程式可能會損失大約最後 15 秒的時間。已完成的劇集或進度低於十秒從頭開始。\n\n 在播客上開啟劇集。  在某一集上進行直播；開始下載到您選擇的資料夾。  或短按選擇鍵可開啟描述和作者。  傳回上一個清單。捲動載入更多頁面。\n\n網路電視\n\n > IPTV 顯示已儲存的播放清單和頻道。選擇新增 M3U 播放清單並按 。輸入播放清單 HTTP(S) 連結或選擇掃描 QR。新增並開啟要求輸入名稱、驗證播放清單、儲存並開啟其頻道。無擴展連結有效；此流程始終將它們視為播放清單。打开而不保存仅适用于本次会话。\n\n方向鍵和左搖桿遵循可見佈局。向上從通道移動到其操作，然後是頂部控制；向下返回網格。不完整的最後一行仍然有一個向下的鄰居。  開啟播放清單或播放頻道；  切換其最愛。  搜尋；選擇重新命名條目或目前播放清單。  提供管理、刷新和過濾功能。\n\n新增後， 返回已儲存的條目，並選擇新的播放清單。開啟而不儲存返回表單。在選項中開啟直接串流將單一 HLS/DASH 或視訊檔案連結與頻道播放清單分開；它的格式是自動的，並且「選擇」會在需要時更改它。\n\n播放時， 開啟視訊品質、音訊語言和節目。選擇帶有向上/向下和  的行以查看來源變體和可用語言； 應用此選擇。如果新格式失敗，播放會重新連線並還原先前的格式。 1080p 和高於 4 Mbps 的位元率不會自動阻止。當播放清單提供XMLTV時，節目顯示標題、時間、描述和下一個節目；向上/向下捲動和  刷新。\n\n連接期間， 或取消停止載入。在播放過程中， 暫停/恢復， 切換收藏夾。直播點恢復直播；分段點播就地恢復，無需尋找。相容的 MP4/MKV 檔案使用視訊播放器控制。\n\n網路和下載\n\n網路： 新增伺服器， 編輯，短按選擇鍵刪除其已儲存的配置。  連接或開啟。  開啟可用選項。在遠端資料夾中， 刷新； 開啟 Jellyfin 詳細資料或從檔案伺服器下載。\n\nJellyfin： > Jellyfin，緊接在 Navidrome 之前，開啟現有已儲存的伺服器。  連線、 新增、 編輯； 也提供刪除連線並確認。影片使用視訊播放器控制；返回將恢復資料夾和選擇。\n\nNavidrome 和 Immich：打開他們的  部分或音樂/圖像條目。  連接、 新增、 編輯； 開啟具有連接、新增、編輯和刪除連接的選項。移除需要新的確認； 取消並保留遠端內容。 Navidrome 使用音樂播放器，Immich 使用影像檢視器。\n\n開啟網路 > 直接連結/QR 或 IPTV > 開始 > 掃描 QR，然後瞄準 HTTP/HTTPS 連結。  或取消不接受就回傳。文字輸入和確認使用系統鍵盤。\n\n下載目的地：進入資料夾，建立一個，開始選擇目前位置。  轉到其父級並在根處取消。傳輸過程中，開始暫停/恢復； 中止。後台或 讓它繼續； > 下載重新開啟進度。\n\n玩家\n\n上面的第一行顯示活動的影片/音樂映射。通常， 開啟部分、 選項和左/右搜尋。設定 > 控制可以交換這些群組：方向按鈕開啟面板和 / 搜尋。水平左搖桿仍然是搜尋控制。直播電台無法搜尋。\n\n 暫停/恢復。垂直右搖桿可改變音量。短按“開始”按鈕，在大約一秒之前鬆開，可最大限度地減少受支援的地方；在迷你播放器中它恢復全螢幕。按住「開始」約一秒鐘可切換 OLED ECO。按住 Select 約一秒可鎖定/解鎖輸入；短按不會鎖定它。\n\n點擊影片以顯示/隱藏控制。拖曳時間軸以尋找可用的位置。  停止全螢幕播放；短按「開始」鍵即可繼續聆聽。\n\n視訊選項：上/下選擇一行；左/右準備音訊/字幕選擇， 應用它； 關閉面板。搜尋將字幕選擇保留在支援的文件上。\n\n音樂選項：上/下選擇；  或左/右更改隨機播放、重複播放或顏色。  > 播放器變更圖稿佈局而不重新啟動音訊。佈局遵循主題或您儲存的選擇。\n\n影像\n\n 放大。  縮小。  旋轉90度。開始重置縮放、位置和旋轉。方向鍵/左搖桿平移；鬆開即可停止運動。\n\n用一根手指拖动进行平移；捏两下即可缩放。點選可顯示/隱藏控制項。  打开Sections， 图像信息。  关闭打开的面板或返回文件。\n\n旋轉循環 0、90、180 和 270 度。右搖桿和兩指扭轉不是旋轉控制。")
