VT_TRANSLATION("The playlist was read, but its audio/video segments contain unusable or incomplete data.", "播放列表已读取，但其音频/视频片段包含不可用或不完整的数据。")
VT_TRANSLATION("The playlist was read, but its audio/video timestamps are unusable. Try another version of the channel.", "播放列表已读取，但其音频/视频时间戳不可用。嘗試該頻道的另一個版本。")
VT_TRANSLATION("The saved configuration will be removed. Files on the server will not change.", "儲存的配置將被刪除。伺服器上的檔案不會改變。")
